 ~50 Words&#xa;Use a Closed-universe Matter File&#xa;Specify Reviewable Deliverables" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="168" y="136" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="Build Synthetic Matter Files&#xa;Lawyer-guided and Reviewed Batches&#xa;Mix Key and Peripheral Documents&#xa;Plant Issues across Multiple Files" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="440" y="136" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="Author Atomic Expert Criteria&#xa;Binary · Equal Weight · No Gold Output&#xa;match_criteria Defines Pass or Fail&#xa;Scope to Deliverables · Sources Optional" style="ellipse;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="712" y="136" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="Package Each Self-contained Task&#xa;tasks/[area]/[workflow]/[scenario]/&#xa;task.json + documents/&#xa;Title · Prompt · Work Type · Tags&#xa;Deliverables · Criteria" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="984" y="136" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="Run Content + Integrity Gates&#xa;Lawyer Guidance and Document Review&#xa;Valid JSON · Title · Criteria · Unique IDs&#xa;Deliverable Lists · No Legacy Weights" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="1256" y="136" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="Release Evolving MIT Repository&#xa;Pinned README: 1,671 Tasks&#xa;24 Practice Areas + Contracting&#xa;Add M&amp;A Diligence Extension" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="1528" y="136" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="Separate Artifact Boundaries&#xa;Public Tasks + Rubrics + Harness&#xa;No Published Train/Dev/Test Split&#xa;Private LAB-AA Holdout Is External" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="2"><mxGeometry x="1800" y="136" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="Harness Loads One Public Task&#xa;task.json + Matter Documents&#xa;System Prompt + Skills + Instructions&#xa;Agent Rubric Access Automatically Fails" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="3"><mxGeometry x="-184" y="456" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="Create a Per-task Podman Sandbox&#xa;--network=none · --cap-drop=ALL&#xa;Documents Read-only&#xa;Workspace + Output Writable" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="3"><mxGeometry x="88" y="456" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="Run the Model–Tool Loop&#xa;Bash · Read · Write · Edit · Glob · Grep&#xa;Default Maximum: 200 Turns&#xa;Save Deliverables · Transcript · Metrics" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="3"><mxGeometry x="360" y="456" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="Resolve + Parse Deliverables&#xa;Exact · Extension · Fuzzy · LLM Match&#xa;DOCX · XLSX · PPTX · PDF → Text&#xa;Load Only Criterion-scoped Files" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="3"><mxGeometry x="632" y="456" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="Judge One Criterion per LLM Call&#xa;Title + Output + match_criteria Prompt&#xa;Default Sonnet 4.6 · Temperature 0&#xa;Anthropic · Google · OpenAI · Mistral&#xa;Return JSON Verdict + Reasoning" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="3"><mxGeometry x="904" y="456" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="Apply Strict All-pass Scoring&#xa;Each Criterion Passes or Fails&#xa;Task = 1 Only When All Criteria Pass&#xa;No Task-level Partial Credit" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="3"><mxGeometry x="1176" y="456" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="Write scores.json + report.html&#xa;Headline: All-pass Task Rate&#xa;Diagnostic: Pooled Criterion Rate&#xa;Heatmap · Coverage · Tokens · Time · Cost" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#607D8B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="3"><mxGeometry x="1448" y="456" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="Use a Separate Private Holdout&#xa;120 Tasks · 24 Practice Areas&#xa;Mirror the Public Task Distribution&#xa;Not Released with the MIT Repository" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="4"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="776" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="Publish Independent LAB-AA Leaderboard&#xa;Artificial Analysis Stirrup Harness&#xa;Single LLM Criterion Judge&#xa;All-pass + Criterion Pass Rates&#xa;Cost · Tokens · Speed · Turns" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#607D8B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="4"><mxGeometry x="1912" y="776" width="200" height="100" as="ge